# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/tailscale/fixtures/cannot-stay
# Asked to stay connected on a reader without the room for it. The runtime's
# reason leads the options page, and the first screen does not claim to stay.
wait-for Connected
expect Runs while Cobalt is open.
expect-missing Stays connected
tap Options
wait-for does not have the 110 MB free
expect Tailscale runs while Cobalt is open instead.
clean
shot tailscale-cannot-stay
